rchived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-17T18:41:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T14:14:25Z","closed_at":"2025-07-18T14:14:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 stable and 4.5 beta3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3 - Arch Linux #1 ZEN SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 10 Jul 2025 17:10:03 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (RPL-P) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900H (20 threads) - 31.04 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using 3D scaling, the screen-space anti-aliasing (FXAA or SMAA) is applied after the image is scaled up, which means it doesn't get rid of aliasing. The solution would be to apply the anti-aliasing filter before the image is scaled up.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable FXAA or SMAA\n2. Set the 3D scaling to 0.25\n3. (optional) Set the mipmap bias to 2 so that the texture filtering doesn't look terrible and crusty\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[3d_scaling_with_screen_space_aa.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21302861/3d_scaling_with_screen_space_aa.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","i